%     is covered. Consistent with Rhin--Viola 2005 and Prellberg arXiv:2609.06895 ("s <= -5 and s >= 7").
%   Title is singular "dilogarithm" (arXiv:1912.03811 misprints it as "dilogarithms").
@article{Hata1993,
